 "about": "Optimized copies of the Dying Light pictures and sounds. The old files under banners/ stay where they were (public URLs). bytes = file size, width/height = decoded size, decodedBytes = width * height * 4 (RGBA in memory or on the GPU). Backgrounds: \"full\" (at most 1920 x 1440) and \"small\" (at most 1280 x 960) for weak devices. Skins: square, whole figure centred with a 4% margin, alpha below 8/255 removed, transparent pixels fully transparent; 512 matches the 512 x 512 layers of the WebGL skin texture array, 256 for Canvas2D / small cells. Sounds: MP3 (plays in every browser incl. Safari / iOS); suggestedGain levels them to a similar loudness (multiply with the channel volume). Videos are never loaded automatically.",
